content.text:
Final reasoning before writing up: the only user-facing failure is `/trips/left` returning 502 after about 3 s, and every failure is ui-dashboard timing out when dialing a travel-service endpoint. That endpoint (`ts4/...c7b5c6d9b-fsftm`) never receives ui-dashboard flows in either period and emits no telemetry in the abnormal period. Silent drops that show up as dial timeouts point to a network partition on that connection, not a pod crash, which would refuse connections quickly.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-service",
      "fault_kind": "network_partition",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, attr_http_response_status_code AS code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='loadgenerator' AND attr_http_response_status_code=502 GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "82 user requests to POST /trips/left returned HTTP 502 through ts-ui-dashboard in the abnormal window, none in normal."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND level='ERROR' AND message LIKE '%dial tcp 10.101.43.206:8080: i/o timeout%' AND message LIKE '%trips/left%'",
          "claim": "ui-dashboard proxy logs repeated 'dial tcp 10.101.43.206:8080: i/o timeout' with status 502 on /api/v1/travelservice/trips/left."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_source, attr_destination, count(*) AS samples, round(sum(value),0) AS flows FROM abnormal_metrics_sum WHERE metric='hubble_flows_processed_total' AND attr_source LIKE '%ui-dashboard%' AND attr_destination LIKE '%travel-service%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "In the abnormal window ui-dashboard flows reach only travel-service pod 74794d67b9-4tmvq; no flows to the second pod c7b5c6d9b-fsftm."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name AS pod, count(*) AS spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY 1",
          "claim": "Only one travel-service pod (74794d67b9-4tmvq) emits spans in the abnormal window; the second pod c7b5c6d9b-fsftm emits none."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) AS n, round(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,0) AS p95_ms, round(avg(duration)/1e6,0) AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE '%trips/left%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard trips/left server spans take about 3 s p95 in the abnormal window, matching the dial timeout, versus fast responses from travel-service."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

